# Keep ACR/Docker context small — large data/ and node_modules stall source upload.
.git
.github
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.venv
**/venv
**/node_modules
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/build
data
**/data/backups
**/*.sql.gz
**/*.dump
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
agent-transcripts
.cursor
*.md
!README.md
coverage
htmlcov
.tmp
tmp
logs
*.log
